{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If tomorrow were doomsday, would you save the world or spend your last moments with a loved one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/extras/\u82f1\u6587.jpg?t=1744179034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Childhood Sweetheart :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I\u2019ll stay with you, now and forever.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/extras/\u82cf\u7433.jpg?t=1744179034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Bold and Decisive Sexy Spy:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Faith, mission, emotions? They\u2019re illusions. Only control ensures survival.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/extras/\u9648\u6960.jpg?t=1744179034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mysterious genius girl:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;You\u2019re the only light in my life and the connection to this world.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/extras/\u827e\u4e3d\u5a05.jpg?t=1744179034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gentle Intellectual Maid:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Cry if you need to. I\u2019m here.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/extras/\u5bab\u67d4.jpg?t=1744179034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innocent noble girl:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Take me with you. Let\u2019s run away together!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/extras/\u827e\u8587.jpg?t=1744179034\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> If you\u2019re into dangerous and beautiful bad girls, we\u2019ve got that too...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Let's just stay in this moment, and after tonight, forget me.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Endless Exploration:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds endings. Every choice shapes the story, making each player\u2019s journey unique with hidden content to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>New Adventure:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fictional world offers endless possibilities. Experience epic romance and thrilling adventure, crafting your own epic tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich interactive content\u2014exploration, combat, and collection\u2014delivers ultimate satisfaction and immersion. The adventure never ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ultimate Visuals:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five distinct heroines\u2014cool, elegant, charming, romantic, and seductive\u2014accompany you across different eras and cultures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292340?t=1744179034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292340?t=1744179034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/816907d2fa42688236001997c1715eb04ef8a399/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744179034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292340/816907d2fa42688236001997c1715eb04ef8a399/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744179034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"cont